  "description": "The proposed works comprise the replacement of existing additions with a new single-storey rear extension, the addition of a modest first-floor rear extension, and the formation of a rear dormer as part of a loft conversion. The scheme also includes associated internal reconfiguration and minor external works, the removal of the existing outbuilding and its replacement with a smaller consolidated bin and garden store, and the reduction of hard surfacing to both the front and rear gardens with the introduction of new soft landscaping. Upgrades to building services, glazing, and the building fabric are also proposed to improve the dwelling’s energy efficiency and overall sustainability.",
